      "message": "Similar, I am hoping this can be similar to `AdvertiseData#getTransportDiscoveryData() -\u003e List\u003cTransportDiscoveryData\u003e`\n\nwith exception of having `mTdsFlagsMask` and `mTransportDataMask` in the `TransportBlock` when it is used for filtering purpose. \n\nThis should significantly reduce your API size",
